for breakfast, so I may change my review after hitting up that one tomorrow."},{"business_id":"MCdFiLl3e7AWenLYzahnRg","review_id":"yQRUEaQMYNDzX-r0Dc1Y3w","date":"2008-07-14T00:53:48","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9190943837165833,"text_excerpt":"Well here is surprise. On our last day of our trip we need a solid breakfast before we go to the Airport. So we look to see what our bed and breakfast recommends. Low and behold there is this little place just around the corner. We walk just about two blocks and it looks like no big deal as we walk up. As we come in I notice the great bold colored prints on the wall. Wow they are really nice .The place has a bit of a retro /homey vibe. We take a look at the menu and a waiter takes our order. In only a few minutes comes this plate with to huge banana buckwheat pancakes for me and tasty looking Huevos Rancheros for my husband. we both hmmm and aaaww. Very good!!! I couldn't finish my plate ..."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
